\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Pricing an observer. The eroded certificate $\Gamma (\tau _1)$ of Proposition\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {prop:observer}(a) (exact), and the finite program of \textup  {\hbox {\mathsurround \z@ \normalfont  (\ignorespaces \ref  {eq:lp}\unskip \@@italiccorr )}} built for the two-stage information structure at $h=\genfrac  {}{}{}1{1}{100}$ (HiGHS; each point a lower bound on $J$). For $\tau _1\le \genfrac  {}{}{}1{3}{100}$ the program finds a better certificate than the eroded triple one---its value settles at the finite value of the pair $\{2,3\}$'s own program, $-0.0675$, within the moment error of that pair's slack $-\genfrac  {}{}{}1{81}{1250}$---while for $\tau _1\ge \genfrac  {}{}{}1{1}{10}$ the two agree up to the moment error $Th/4=\genfrac  {}{}{}1{3}{1000}$. The shaded band is the certified bracket $[\genfrac  {}{}{}1{3}{25},\genfrac  {}{}{}1{6-\sqrt  {29}}{5}]$ for the critical installation time.\relax }}{16}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:observer}{{4}{16}{Pricing an observer. The eroded certificate $\Gamma (\tau _1)$ of Proposition~\ref {prop:observer}(a) (exact), and the finite program of \eqref {eq:lp} built for the two-stage information structure at $h=\tfr 1{100}$ (HiGHS; each point a lower bound on $J$). For $\tau _1\le \tfr 3{100}$ the program finds a better certificate than the eroded triple one---its value settles at the finite value of the pair $\{2,3\}$'s own program, $-0.0675$, within the moment error of that pair's slack $-\tfr {81}{1250}$---while for $\tau _1\ge \tfr 1{10}$ the two agree up to the moment error $Th/4=\tfr 3{1000}$. The shaded band is the certified bracket $[\tfr 3{25},\tfr {6-\sqrt {29}}5]$ for the critical installation time.\relax }{figure.caption.11}{}}
